Lifecycle events of a run carry the run id chat() was given: chat completions (stream and
structured output) and responses structured output use options.runId, as the responses stream
already does. A Goal-bound run's delivery log refuses events of another run id. Redo this patch
when @tanstack/openai-base is upgraded.

